rst"]},{"day":150,"from":{"x":4,"y":5},"to":{"x":4,"y":4},"after":{"x":4,"y":4},"kind":"moved","hBefore":{"tx":5,"ty":4},"hAfter":{"tx":6,"ty":4},"stack":["Game.travelTo","Object.w","walkTo"]},{"day":151,"from":{"x":4,"y":4},"to":{"x":4,"y":3},"after":{"x":4,"y":3},"kind":"moved","hBefore":{"tx":6,"ty":4},"hAfter":{"tx":6,"ty":3},"stack":["Game.travelTo","Object.w","forageTripSeedFirst"]},{"day":151,"from":{"x":4,"y":3},"to":{"x":4,"y":4},"after":{"x":4,"y":4},"kind":"moved","hBefore":{"tx":6,"ty":3},"hAfter":{"tx":6,"ty":3},"stack":["Game.travelTo","Object.w","walkTo"]},{"day":152,"from":{"x":4,"y":4},"to":{"x":4,"y":3},"after":{"x":4,"y":4},"kind":"refused","hBefore":{"tx":6,"ty":3},"hAfter":{"tx":6,"ty":3},"stack":["Game.travelTo","Object.w","forageTripSeedFirst"]}],"lairTile":{"x":7,"y":4},"milestones":{"wave4Day":116,"regionalDay":57,"omenStartDay":120,"omenStage1Day":124,"omenStage2Day":129,"firstPresentDay":129,"lastPresentDay":152,"traceRows":302,"travelEvents":617},"transcript":["A woman, maybe 40s, with sun-creased eyes heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 50s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 50s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ashanti waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A woman, maybe 50s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Renee heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 50s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A person, maybe 50s, with thick glasses heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Grace heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","Ryan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","👥 Fatima heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Ashanti waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Jesse waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Stonebridge with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Oscar waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Ashford with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Ashanti waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Ashanti waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","📓 Codex: First link formed with Stonebridge. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","Grace leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Nightlight. Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Nightlight: Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Never wade in — The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Zoe waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table II with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Ashanti waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Alba waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Ashanti waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Lena waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Bloodied with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Ashanti waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Zoe waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table II with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Ashanti waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Victor waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Ashanti waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Ashanti waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Zoe waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table II with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Big-Eyes: Feed it nothing. It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence. (Raj lived to tell it, twice — the village pieced it together.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Feed it nothing — It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence.","Ashanti waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Ashanti heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Alejandro heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Fatima heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Victor waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","👥 Ashanti heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Fatima heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Lena waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Bloodied with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Tanya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Wojciech heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Fatima heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Tanya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Ashanti heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Alejandro heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Zoe waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table II with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Alejandro heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Tanya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Raj heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Wojciech heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""],"anchoredLines":[{"day":10,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — The Anaconda Empress. It's here."},{"day":12,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Sunbasker. It's here."},{"day":26,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — The Ugly Beast. It's here."},{"day":28,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — The Ugly Beast. It's here."},{"day":30,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Hushpuppy. It's here."},{"day":32,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Hushpuppy. It's here."},{"day":35,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Night Court. It's here."},{"day":48,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Cliffhanger. It's here."},{"day":49,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Cliffhanger. It's here."},{"day":59,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Old Gavel. It's here."},{"day":60,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Big Ugly. It's here."},{"day":78,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Big Loud. It's here."},{"day":81,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — The Anaconda Empress. It's here."},{"day":83,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — tick. It's here."},{"day":93,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Big Loud. It's here."},{"day":98,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — The Anaconda Empress. It's here."},{"day":121,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Big Loud. It's here."},{"day":129,"line":"🗺️ Scouts found its lair — tile 7,4. THE HERALD — the sky, getting bigger. It is WAITING. You cannot face it alone. Sound the call."},{"day":129,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Stonebridge in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":134,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Stonebridge in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":136,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Loud-Eyes. It's here."},{"day":139,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 0 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":144,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Thornfield in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":149,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 1,950 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":149,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Big Big. It's here."},{"day":152,"line":"◈ THE WAR PATH — The body count, itemized. The System is not making this up — it was filming. THE HERALD came. Named and located — the war council knew its face. They faced Loud-Eyes and lived to sit here. They faced The Suburb and lived to sit here. Even now the wave-5 bar reads: blood your fighters (0 of 2 veterans)."}],"instrumentTranscripts":[],"instrumentErrors":[],"interceptorErrors":[],"travelErrors":[],"maxWave":4,"wave4":1,"wave5":0,"w4Day":116,"w5Day":null,"national":1,"table":1,"won":1,"days":151,"gameDays":152,"endReason":"over-other","endOmen":{"stage":2,"day":129},"endLinks":3,"endPend":false,"endPendMid":null,"deaths":[{"day":7,"kind":"monster","who":"hummice","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":8,"kind":"villager","who":"gen_8mnn7vp","cause":"the wild","player":true},{"day":8,"kind":"