:["A woman, maybe 50s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 30s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Dmitri heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 30s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Alfredo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Alfredo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 50s waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A woman, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 40s, with tattooed arms heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","DeShawn heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ghada heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Alfredo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Dmitri heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 DeShawn heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","📓 Codex: First link formed with Thornfield. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","👥 Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Aroha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Lena waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","👥 DeShawn heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Ghada heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Ghada heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Alfredo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Spool: Feed it nothing. It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence. (Olivia lived to tell it, twice — the village pieced it together.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Feed it nothing — It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence.","Alfredo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","DeShawn heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Malik waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","👥 Olivia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Ghada heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ghada heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Malik waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Onni heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Leo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Hannah heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🍲 Haven opens the granary — 4,438 kcal, all it holds. An honest feast, not a grand one. They count it anyway. (Trust +9 with each — 3 grieving fire(s); theirs waits.)","👥 Caleb heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Aroha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Hannah heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Wren waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Ashford with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Aroha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Leo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Thabo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Leo heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Maya waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Stonebridge with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","◈ THE TABLE IS SET. A ring of pale light waits — take your seat from Haven when you are ready. Nothing is final until you sit.","👥 Victor heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Hannah heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\""],"anchoredLines":[{"day":20,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Dustboar. It's here."},{"day":25,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — The Big Stare. It's here."},{"day":33,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Extended Warranty. It's here."},{"day":56,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — The Eulogy. It's here."},{"day":59,"line":"🗺️ Scouts found its lair — tile 8,4. THE HERALD — the sky, getting bigger. It is WAITING. You cannot face it alone. Sound the call."},{"day":59,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Emberhold in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":64,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 2,140 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":68,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Ad Break. It's here."},{"day":69,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 2,310 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":74,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Emberhold in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":75,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — The Herald. It's here."},{"day":78,"line":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."},{"day":78,"line":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."},{"day":78,"line":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."},{"day":79,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Thornfield in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 1,860 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":86,"line":"Something pads into the clearing — Buffering. It's here."},{"day":89,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD fed in the night — 2,170 kcal gone from your stores. It is eating the realm while you deliberate."},{"day":89,"line":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic."},{"day":91,"line":"\"THE HERALD came. Named and located — the war council knew its face. They faced Big-Eyes and lived to sit here. They faced The Loud Beast a